  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 (2026-09-29) - API Surface and Null-Safety Refinements\n\n      Breaking Change:\n      • DefaultFormatter is now internal; use Formatter.Format(...) or Formatter.GetFormatter(...) instead\n\n      Formatter API:\n      • GetFormatter now accepts Type? and returns the default formatter for null input\n      • Unregistered non-null types continue to use the default formatter\n      • XML documentation now describes the null-safe fallback contract\n\n      Internal Maintenance:\n      • Renamed Builder's private separator constant for clarity\n      • Clarified enumerable and formatter-region naming\n      • Added scoped warning suppression for DEBUG-only stream diagnostics\n      • Removed redundant explicit imports supplied by implicit/global usings\n      • Refined XML documentation references and implementation descriptions\n\n      Compatibility:\n      • Formatter.Format, formatter registration, Formatter<T>, and public Builder APIs are unchanged\n      • Direct DefaultFormatter usage must migrate to the public Formatter facade\n\n      For details: https://github.com/CsabaDu/Portamical/blob/master/Portamical.Core.Formatting/README.md",
